gent can only move to empty cells (i.e., cells that are not blocked).\n  # Note: The agent must face the workshop to perform the USE action.\n\n  # Additional note: The `env.world.cookbook.recipes` is a dictionary mapping output indices to ingredient counts and workshop info.\n  # Example recipe format: {output_index: {ingredient_index: count, \"workshop\": workshop_index}}\n\n  # Let's implement this function step by step.\n  # ...\n\n  # Your implementation here\n  return []", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
